## Do not
<!-- TODO(owner): add the project's own red lines. -->
- Do not create or modify files under `.github/workflows/` (CI runs from the hub).
- Do not commit secrets, `.env` files with real values, or personal data in fixtures.
- Do not weaken or suppress an architecture rule, lint rule or coverage
  threshold to make a check pass; change the rule in a reviewed PR instead.
- Do not edit an applied database migration; add a new one.
__DO_NOT__

